interpretation = f'HR-SBP scatter analysis for paraplegic patient: {n_points} paired measurements analyzed. No autonomic dysreflexia pattern detected (0/{n_points} events in hypertensive-bradycardia zone). HR-SBP correlation r={corr_coef:.2f} (p={p_value:.3f}). Current hemodynamic profile shows mean SBP {np.mean(paired_sbp):.0f} mmHg (hypotensive baseline) with HR {np.mean(paired_hr):.0f} bpm. Elevated shock index ({shock_index}) suggests compensated hypoperfusion rather than autonomic dysreflexia.'

plt.close()